<title>USA: Promo Tel sets reverse split, name change.</title>
<headline>Promo Tel sets reverse split, name change.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Promo Tel Inc said Friday that its board of directors had authorized a one-for-six reverse split of the company's common stock, effective October 18.</p>
<p>The company also said that the board has voted to change the name of the company to DigiTEC 2000 Inc, with the new proposed NASDAQ symbol of DIGC.</p>
</text>
